// 设置模块：/settings 子树的导航与表单词条
// 简体中文 · 模块 pages/settings（路由见 core/modules.jsonc，键的分组注释见 core/canonical.jsonc）
{
	"$schema": "../../../types/dict.schema.json",
	"entries": {
		"Public profile": "公开资料",
		"Account": "账户",
		"Appearance": "外观",
		"Accessibility": "辅助功能",
		"Emails": "电子邮件",
		"Password and authentication": "密码与身份验证",
		"Two-factor authentication": "双因素认证",
		"SSH and GPG keys": "SSH 与 GPG 密钥",
		"Saved replies": "保存的回复",
		"Billing and plans": "账单与套餐",
		"Developer settings": "开发者设置",
		"Danger Zone": "危险区域",
		"Update profile": "更新资料",
		// —— 公开资料表单（/settings/profile）——
		"Name": "姓名",
		"Your name may appear around GitHub where you contribute or are mentioned. You can remove it at any time.": "你的姓名可能会出现在 GitHub 上你贡献或被提及的地方。你可以随时删除它。",
		"Public email": "公开邮箱",
		"You can manage verified email addresses in your email settings": "你可以在电子邮件设置中管理已验证的电子邮箱地址",
		// 「email settings」是链接 → 拆开时只剩链接前片段；译文以「，」收尾以便与链接文本衔接
		"You can manage verified email addresses in your": "你想管理已验证的电子邮箱地址，请前往",
		"Bio": "个人简介",
		"Pronouns": "人称代词",
		"Don't specify": "不指定",
		"URL": "网址",
		"Social accounts": "社交账号",
		// 属性词条（aria-label）：社交账号输入框按序号各有一份
		"Link to social profile 1": "社交资料链接 1",
		"Link to social profile 2": "社交资料链接 2",
		"Link to social profile 3": "社交资料链接 3",
		"Link to social profile 4": "社交资料链接 4",
		// `<strong>@mention</strong>` 切分：You can / @mention / 其余；
		// 第三段含源码换行缩进，整段一条（@mention 本身保持英文）。
		// 译文末尾**不要**带空格：walker 会保留原节点的前导空格，自带空格会变成双空格
		"You can": "你可以",
		"other users and organizations to link to them.": "其他用户和组织来链接他们。",
		"You can @mention other users and organizations to link to them.": "你可以 @提及其他用户和组织来链接他们。",
		"Company": "公司",
		// 公司提示句同样被 `<strong>@mention</strong>` 切开（You can / @mention / 末段）。
		// 末段的译文要能直接接在「你可以 @mention 」后面读通——walker 会保留原节点的前导空格，
		// 实机拼出来是「你可以 @mention 你公司的 GitHub 组织来链接它。」
		"You can @mention your company’s GitHub organization to link it.": "你可以 @提及公司的 GitHub 组织来链接它。",
		"your company’s GitHub organization to link it.": "你公司的 GitHub 组织来链接它。",
		"Location": "位置",
		"Display current local time": "显示当前本地时间",
		"Other users will see the time difference from their local time.": "其他用户将看到与其本地时间的时差。",
		"Time zone": "时区",
		// ORCID 官方把该标识符叫 ORCID iD（大小写固定），中文文献惯用「ORCID 标识符」。
		// **绝不能填成与键同形的 "ORCID iD"**：引擎会每轮命中并对同一个值重复写入
		// nodeValue，观察器自我触发成死循环（门禁也会直接报错，见 tooling/checks/dict.ts）
		"ORCID iD": "ORCID 标识符",
		"ORCID provides a persistent identifier - an ORCID iD - that distinguishes you from other researchers. Learn more at ORCID.org.": "ORCID 提供一个持久标识符（ORCID iD），用于把你与其他研究者区分开。在 ORCID.org 了解更多。",
		// 「ORCID.org」是链接 → 整句在链接处被拆开，链接前片段单独成条
		"ORCID provides a persistent identifier - an ORCID iD - that distinguishes you from other researchers. Learn more at": "ORCID 提供一个持久标识符（ORCID iD），用于把你与其他研究者区分开。在",
		"All of the fields on this page are optional and can be deleted at any time, and by filling them out, you're giving us consent to share this data wherever your user profile appears. Please see our privacy statement to learn more about how we use this information.": "本页所有字段均为可选，且随时可以删除；填写这些字段即表示你同意我们在你的用户个人资料出现的任何位置分享这些数据。请查看我们的隐私声明，进一步了解我们如何使用这些信息。",
		// 「privacy statement」是链接 → 整句在链接处被拆开，链接前片段单独成条
		"All of the fields on this page are optional and can be deleted at any time, and by filling them out, you're giving us consent to share this data wherever your user profile appears. Please see our": "本页所有字段均为可选，且随时可以删除；填写这些字段即表示你同意我们在你的用户个人资料出现的任何位置分享这些数据。请查看我们的",
		"privacy statement": "隐私声明",
		// —— 头像与「贡献与动态」——
		"Profile picture": "头像",
		"Contributions & activity": "贡献与动态",
		"Make profile private and hide activity": "将个人资料设为私有并隐藏动态",
		"Enabling this will hide your contributions and activity from your GitHub profile and from social features like followers, stars, feeds, leaderboards and releases.": "启用后，你的贡献和动态将从 GitHub 个人资料以及关注者、星标、动态流、排行榜和发布等社交功能中隐藏。",
		"Include private contributions on my profile": "在个人资料中包含私有贡献",
		"Your contribution graph, achievements, and activity overview will show your private contributions without revealing any repository or organization information. Read more.": "你的贡献图、成就和活动概览将显示你的私有贡献，但不会透露任何仓库或组织信息。阅读更多。",
		// 「Read more」是链接 → 整句在链接处被拆开，链接前片段单独成条
		"Your contribution graph, achievements, and activity overview will show your private contributions without revealing any repository or organization information.": "你的贡献图、成就和活动概览将显示你的私有贡献，但不会透露任何仓库或组织信息。",
		"Read more.": "阅读更多。",
		// —— 资料设置（成就展示）——
		"Profile settings": "资料设置",
		"Show Achievements on my profile": "在个人资料中显示成就",
		"Your achievements will be shown on your profile.": "你的成就将显示在个人资料中。",
		"Update preferences": "更新偏好设置",
		// —— GitHub Developer Program ——
		"GitHub Developer Program": "GitHub 开发者计划",
		"Building an application, service, or tool that integrates with GitHub? Join the GitHub Developer Program, or read more about it at our GitHub developer program.": "正在构建与 GitHub 集成的应用、服务或工具？加入 GitHub 开发者计划，或进一步了解我们的 GitHub 开发者计划。",
		// 说明句被「GitHub Docs」链接拆成两个节点：链接前片段 + 链接文本 + 链接后整段
		"GitHub Docs": "GitHub 文档",
		"has guides, API and webhook references, information about creating GitHub Apps and other resources for building applications that integrate with GitHub. Make sure your contact information is up-to-date below. Thanks for being a member!": "其中包含指南、API 与 webhook 参考、创建 GitHub Apps 的说明，以及构建与 GitHub 集成的应用所需的其他资源。请确认下方你的联系信息是最新的。感谢你成为会员！",
		"Support email address": "支持电子邮件地址",
		"An email address where GitHub users can contact you for support.": "供 GitHub 用户联系你寻求支持时使用的电子邮箱地址。",
		"Product or company website": "产品或公司网站",
		"The URL for the product, company, or service that integrates with GitHub.": "与 GitHub 集成的产品、公司或服务的 URL。",
		"Update contact information": "更新联系信息",
		"Leave the program": "退出计划",
